    "clientName": "Acme Manufacturing Co.",
    "assessor": "Limen Labs — Cyber Aware Creations",
    "scopeNote": "Enterprise IT and plant-floor OT across four North American sites. Twelve months after a supplier-borne compromise; the board mandated Adaptive (Tier 4) maturity for Govern and Protect, with a Repeatable (Tier 3) baseline elsewhere. Two subcategories assessed as out of scope — see notes.",
    "assessedAt": "2026-06-18"
  },
